# Dead-man's switch for ops/dashboards-timer-check. Paste a ping URL from
# healthchecks.io, Cronitor or similar and the daily check starts pinging it
# on success; that service alarms when the pings STOP, which is the only way
# to hear about a dead box, a dead network or a dead user manager -- all of
# which produce silence here. Unset, nothing is sent and nothing breaks.
# Must NOT point at anything hosted on this VPS.
# HEALTHCHECK_URL=https://hc-ping.com/<uuid>
HEALTHCHECK_URL=https://hc-ping.com/YOUR-UUID-HERE
HEALTHCHECK_URL=https://hc-ping.com/164167e2-3682-41bd-96b6-09d62de19ea5
